Exit codes:
  0  success
  1  fail closed (the message names the cause)
  2  usage error
EOF
            ;;
        disallow-direct)
            cat <<'EOF'
egresslock disallow-direct PROFILE HOST:PORT

Shortcut for `egresslock disallow PROFILE HOST:PORT --direct`:
remove a direct firewall rule. Removing the rule also ends the
