Exit codes:
  0  success
  1  fail closed (the message names the cause)
  2  usage error
EOF
            ;;
        allow-host)
            cat <<'EOF'
egresslock allow-host PROFILE HOST:PORT

Compatibility name for `egresslock allow PROFILE HOST:PORT --direct`
(kept so existing scripts keep working; expect removal in a later
