Exit codes:
  0  success
  1  fail closed (the message names the cause)
  2  usage error
EOF
            ;;
        init)
            cat <<'EOF'
egresslock init NAME [--subnet CIDR]

Write NAME.conf and an empty NAME-allowlist in the account's
config directory (ACCOUNT_HOME/.config/egresslock/). The starter
routes application traffic through the gateway only, so it denies
every destination until you add one with
`egresslock allow NAME HOST[:PORT]` (DNS to the bridge resolver
is still allowed). Then run `egresslock ensure NAME`.

Arguments and flags:
  NAME               profile name (required)
  --subnet CIDR      private CIDR for the profile's own bridge
                     network — the range its containers get addresses
                     from; internal plumbing, not a LAN or access
                     grant. Optional; auto-picked if omitted. Pass
