  --subnet=CIDR      same as --subnet CIDR

Examples:
  egresslock init work
  egresslock init work --subnet 10.199.1.0/24

Exit codes:
  0  success
  1  fail closed (the message names the cause)
  2  usage error
EOF
            ;;
        list)
