Kit and AppArmor checks live in egresslock-setup (see
`egresslock-setup --help`).

Arguments and flags:
  --workloads  also scan running workload containers (advisory): list
               and inspect them, and read their capabilities and
               no-new-privileges state. Bare doctor is a fast host
